Hi,

then instead of running that last function, run:

    single_protein = MSstats:::.prepareSingleProteinForGC(single_protein)
    is_single_subject = MSstats:::.checkSingleSubject(single_protein)
    has_tech_reps = MSstats:::.checkTechReplicate(single_protein)

    fitted_model = MSstats:::.fitModelSingleProtein(single_protein, contrast_matrix,

                                              has_tech_reps, is_single_subject,
                                              repeated, groups, samples_info,
                                              save_fitted_models, has_imputed)

this will tell us what the actual error is

Kind regards,
Mateusz

