Hi,

then it's a known problem that we have no control over:

https://stackoverflow.com/questions/77481539/error-in-initializeptr-function-cholmod-factor-ldeta-not-provided-by-pack
try running the following and refreshing your R session:

remove.packages("Matrix")
remove.packages("lme4")

install.packages("lme4", type = "source")

library(lme4)

Kind regards,
Mateusz

